Subject: [PATCH 6/9] fix(todo): keep section and completed in sync; repair
 legacy completed tasks

'Move to completed' changed only section, so tasks in Completed rendered
unchecked and were excluded from progress. Add todoModel (moveTask,
setTaskChecked, summarizeTasks); items already stored as section=completed are
treated as completed. 'N tasks left' now ignores checked tasks.
Tests: stability-todo-model (5). No component/browser test was run.
